stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> IDLE

  IDLE --> PRE: accept and hit_latency > 1
  IDLE --> IDLE: hit at latency 1
  IDLE --> WB: miss and dirty victim
  IDLE --> FILL: miss clean or free way

  PRE --> IDLE: hit resolves
  PRE --> WB: miss and dirty victim
  PRE --> FILL: miss clean or free way

  WB --> FILL: mem_ack
  FILL --> IDLE: mem_ack fill_done

  IDLE: Accept request
  PRE: Remaining hit latency
  WB: Drain dirty victim
  FILL: Fetch block from mem_stub
